# BlankStare needs no environment variables and has no .env file.
#
# It is a browser extension with no server. Its keys are all optional: a
# Google Gemini key, a Groq key and a YouTube key. They are pasted into the
# extension's Settings page and kept in the user's own browser
# (chrome.storage.sync). They never touch this repository.
#
# This file exists because every repo carries one (repo standards section 1),
# and so nobody goes looking for a missing .env.
